{
  "voice": "成人男声｜老师清晰",
  "reference": "/Users/zhaozixu/Documents/Codex/2026-06-04/new-chat/work/full_voice_catalog/12-adult-male-teacher-clear.wav",
  "cfg_value": 1.35,
  "inference_timesteps": 12,
  "normalize": false,
  "sentence_method": "one complete sentence per generation",
  "word_method": "independent word generation, not extracted from sentence audio",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Wukong, Tiangong, Tianwen ... Do you know where the names of Chinese space programmes come from?",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The well-known moon mission Chang'e is named after a goddess who flew to the moon.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "This mission was important in studying the moon's surface.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Wukong, the dark matter particle explorer, is named after a Chinese superhero, Monkey King.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "According to Journey to the West, Monkey King has a pair of sharp eyes which can tell the difference between good and evil.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The Wukong satellite is just as sharp-eyed as Monkey King to help scientists search for dark matter in space.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "The name of the space station, Tiangong, means 'Heavenly Palace'.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "In Chinese myths, this is the home of Tian Di.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Now, Tiangong Space Station is a home for Chinese astronauts in space.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Tianwen, China's Mars mission, gets its name from the poem Tianwen by Qu Yuan.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Qu Yuan is a well-known poet from ancient China.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "In Tianwen, he had questions about the sky, stars, nature, myths and the real world, showing his hunger for truth.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "Perhaps the Tianwen missions will end up answering some of Qu Yuan's questions.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "If you look into more names of Chinese space programmes, you will find that they all have beautiful meanings.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "We, the Chinese people, have a long-cherished space dream.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "Therefore, the naming of Chinese space programmes is taken very seriously.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "Scientists, from junior members to experienced leaders, are also working hard to sweep away setbacks, without letting any challenges disappoint them.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-17.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "The names are like postcards to the world, showing our determination in space exploration.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-18.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
